---
layout: base.njk
title: On-going
description: 1ヶ月経過したけれども期限がまだ来ていない動画、あるいはYoutubeなどの期限が設定されていないものをまとめたページ
pagination:
  data: collections.ongoing
  size: 7
  alias: posts
---

<div class="ongoing-container">

  <div class="header">
    {{ description }}
  </div>

    {% set currentYear = "" %}
    {% for post in posts %}
    <article class="post-card">
        {% set postYear = post.date.getFullYear() %}
        {% if postYear != "" %}
          <h2 class="currentYear">{{ postYear }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
      <div class="post-card-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateJP }}</time>
        {% if post.data.tags %}
          <div class="post-card-tags">
            {% for tag in post.data.tags | excludeTag("posts") %}
              <span class="post-tag">{{ tag }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
      </div>
          <h2 class="post-card-title">
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
            <svg role="img" width="13.35px" height="13.35px" class="line-left-to-up"><use href="#line-left-to-up"></use></svg>
          </h2>
          {% if post.data.description %}
            <p class="post-card-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        {% endif %}

    </article>
    {% endfor %}

</div>
